  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on young people, especially young women as a fast-growing demographic and the future of the country and aims to ensure that they are not left behind in the context of the rapid changes linked to the reform process. In practical terms, the project aims to ensure that young people, particularly young women and those at-risk groups, including repatriated people and their families from conflict zones, returned migrant workers and their families continue to have equitable access t</narrative>
